I find it odd that you use this micro example, since it is such a good 
example of a situation where an auction works.

Me and two others wash up on an island. We may wish to build, farm,
harvest, mine,... Leaving the whole island as a commons may lead to
conflict. It may work out much better to divvy up the island.

